title: A New International
subtitle: In Moscow, Lenin calls the world's communists together.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1919 and month = 3 and crisis = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 1
on-arrival: {!
RG.setRole('eberlein', 'Delegate to Moscow, as "Max Albert"');
!}

= A New International

Hugo Eberlein, travelling as "Max Albert", has reached Moscow after weeks on goods trains and sledges. He is the only delegate of a real mass party among the fifty or so in the Kremlin. Lenin and Zinoviev want to found a Third International at once.

Eberlein's mandate, written [? if luxemburg_alive = 1 : at Luxemburg's insistence ?][? if luxemburg_alive = 0 : on Luxemburg's last advice ?], says the new International is premature: without the big parties of the West it would be a Russian department. A telegram can still reach him through Stockholm.

- @abstain: Eberlein keeps to his mandate and abstains.
- @for: Wire Eberlein to vote for the founding.
- @against: Vote against.

@abstain
subtitle: The party joins anyway, on its own terms. Zinoviev will note who hesitated.
on-arrival: {!
Q.comintern_member = 1;
Q.e19_eberlein_line = 1;
Q.independence += 4;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -8);
RG.ecci('lenin', 2);
RG.news('Communist International founded in Moscow; the German delegate abstains', 3);
!}

On 4 March the congress founds the Communist International. Eberlein abstains, alone. A few weeks later the Zentrale accepts membership.

@for
subtitle: Zinoviev will be grateful, and so will his treasury.
on-arrival: {!
Q.comintern_member = 1;
Q.e19_eberlein_line = 2;
Q.independence -= 6;
Q.moscow_subsidy = 1;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', 12);
RG.ecci('bukharin', 6);
RG.news('Communist International founded in Moscow, with the German party', 3);
!}

Eberlein reads our telegram aloud and votes yes. The hall sings the *Internationale*, and the first money for the German party leaves Moscow sewn into a courier's coat.

@against
subtitle: Luxemburg's argument taken to its end. The party stays outside, and Moscow will not forget.
on-arrival: {!
Q.comintern_member = 0;
Q.e19_eberlein_line = 3;
Q.independence += 12;
Q.uspd_relation += 4;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
RG.ecci('all', -10);
RG.news('German communists vote against the new International', 3);
RG.ledger('The German party voted against the founding of the Communist International, and stayed outside it.', 'e19_ci_against');
!}

Eberlein votes no. The congress founds the International all the same. Lenin calls it a misunderstanding that time will correct.
